/tmp/c5/15/eb/be83af3b8bfca71bf41274255e1e8382.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ef/b9/e5/3626d9a551a7c58d2059cb920fd515ab.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ef/b9/e5/3626d9a551a7c58d2059cb920fd515ab.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/22/f2/bd/793a7cfb299dbbcc1cf4badb80656c1d.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/22/f2/bd/793a7cfb299dbbcc1cf4badb80656c1d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c8/d9/66/44c7d9ec313e92e979fdada4546f9564.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/c8/d9/66/44c7d9ec313e92e979fdada4546f9564.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b1/c4/83/5e7953c9b32f9f4badd797b8483e013d.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b1/c4/83/5e7953c9b32f9f4badd797b8483e013d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Thiết kế nâng hạ gót tiện lợi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Khóa kéo bên hông tiện lợi, mang và cởi dễ dàng, khóa kéo nhạy, giúp loại bỏ mọi sự rắc rối\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Họa tiết rõ ràng, tinh tế\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Mặt giày được làm từ chất liệu da lợn. Thoải mái, mềm mại tinh tế, mũi giày tròn và rộng, không gây áp lực lên ngón chân.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Đế: Đế cao su.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Dây giày trang trí , đường chỉ may thủ công\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThông tin sản phẩm\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Mặt giày: da lợn (da lộn)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Màu sắc: đen / kaki\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Đế giày: Đế cao su \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b0/09/55/703c7af5cd5